 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-01-03",
   "text": "This bill makes it unlawful for a person who is not a licensed gun dealer to transfer a firearm at a gun show. \n The prohibition does not apply to a transfer to a licensed manufacturer, importer, dealer, or collector. \n A violator is subject to criminal penalties—a fine, a prison term, or both."
  }
